        <mxCell id="layoutc47" value="96" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#555555;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1A1A1A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;startArrow=block;endArrow=block;startFill=1;endFill=1;startSize=4;endSize=4;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="60" y="810" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="636" y="810" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="layoutc48" value="46" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#555555;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1A1A1A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;startArrow=block;endArrow=block;startFill=1;endFill=1;startSize=4;endSize=4;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="46" y="520" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="46" y="796" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="layoutc49" value="&lt;b&gt;WHERE EACH PART GOES&lt;/b&gt; (inside mm: x from left wall, y up from floor, z back from front panel)&lt;br&gt;1  OLED: behind the front window, glass against the wall, z 0–4.5&lt;br&gt;MB Main board (Vero 74 × 40) on four 5 mm standoffs hot-glued to the left panel, x 5–6.6, z 5–79.&lt;br&gt;3  DevKitC-1: plugged into the MB sockets, components facing in, antenna at the front. x 6.6–20.2, y 8–37, z 6–71.&lt;br&gt;5  Charger: on a 2 mm spacer on the floor at the front, turned 90° so its USB-C pushes into the CHARGE slot in the right side panel. x 16–42, z 0–17&lt;br&gt;4  LiPo 10 × 25 × 47: on its side on the floor against the right wall, x 32–42, y 0–25, z 27–74 (foam tape). Lead end at the front, toward the charger.&lt;br&gt;6  Boost: floor, behind the charger, x 15–26, z 28–50&lt;br&gt;10 Accelerometer: in a 7-pin socket on carrier GC (24 × 17), on two 5 mm standoffs hot-glued to the right panel above the battery. x 24–42, y 25.5–41.5, z 45–69 (re-learn faces in Stage 2 calibration)&lt;br&gt;7  Amp: in a 7-pin socket on carrier AC (20 × 22), on two 5 mm standoffs hot-glued under the top panel. x 21–41, y 22–42, z 6–28&lt;br&gt;9  Mic: under the top panel, port over the hole at z 37 (x 21, centre)&lt;br&gt;8  Speaker: glued inside the lid, magnet reaches z 72. Keep everything else in front of z 70.&lt;br&gt;P7 Screw blocks: back top corners, z 84–92, M3 nut on the inner end&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;FLASHING&lt;/b&gt;: the DevKit USB now faces the lid inside the box. Take the 2 lid screws out to plug in.&lt;br&gt;Charge only through the right-side CHARGE port, never both at once. The port faces the desk when the cube rests on its right side (mode D), so charge in any other position." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1A1A1A;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="130" width="440" height="600" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="frame" name="5 · Test frame 1:1 (print)">
