        <mxCell id="framec1" value="KEY CUBE  ·  OPEN TEST FRAME  ·  CUT 1 : 1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=16;fontColor=#1A1A1A;spacing=0;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="20" width="770" height="24" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="framec2" value="A bolt-together frame for testing before you build the box. Everything comes apart. All parts are from tronic.lk (table D on page 1). Boards are cut from 90 × 70 dot boards (TA1057). Print at 100 % and check the 50 mm bar. Black = drill or cut. Dashed = part outline, mark only. Sizes in mm from each board's top-left corner." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9;fontColor=#555555;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="44" width="770" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
