        <mxCell id="framec21" value="Post holes Ø3.2 at (4, 4) (56, 4) (4, 56) (56, 56)&lt;br&gt;OLED standoff holes Ø3.2 at (14.3, 11.3) (45.7, 11.3)&lt;br&gt;(14.3, 40.8) (45.7, 40.8): mark them from your OLED&lt;br&gt;Slot 13 × 5 at (23.5, 9.3): the OLED plug passes through&lt;br&gt;Orange dashed: touch strip on the front, under the OLED" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=8;fontColor=#1A1A1A;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="402.22" width="260" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
