        <mxCell id="framec41" value="Inside the Ø30 circle, drill the dot-board holes out&lt;br&gt;to Ø1.5 (bit TA0149): that is the grille.&lt;br&gt;Dashed Ø40: speaker rim, on the inside.&lt;br&gt;4 clamp holes Ø3.2 at (14.8, 14.8) (45.2, 14.8)&lt;br&gt;(14.8, 45.2) (45.2, 45.2): washers Ø7 grip the rim." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=8;fontColor=#1A1A1A;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="402.22" width="260" height="70" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
