        <mxCell id="framec61" value="Tie holes Ø3 at z 8 / 45 / 82, x 10.5 and z 8 / 82, x 49.5: a tie goes through the hole,&lt;br&gt;around the post under the tray and over the tray edge. LiPo: holes at (36, 38.5) and (66, 38.5),&lt;br&gt;the tie goes over the battery and around the right post. Carrier GC: tie through (53, 26.5) / (69.5, 26.5)." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=8;fontColor=#1A1A1A;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="760.22" width="360" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
