        <mxCell id="mainboardc278" value="7-pin female socket, GY-45 outline&lt;br&gt;dashed. Check your board's pin order&lt;br&gt;and solder the socket to match.&lt;br&gt;Wire to MB as C4 (SA0, INT2 open).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Final box: two 5 mm standoffs&lt;br&gt;hot-glued to the right panel above&lt;br&gt;the battery. Test frame: tie onto T1." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=8;fontColor=#1A1A1A;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="744" y="860" width="300" height="119" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
